    <panel_attributes>title=SD11 Complete a task with its actual time
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=StudyPlanGenerator~g
obj=StudyTask~t
obj=StudyPlanRepository~r
obj=ProgressTracker~p

u-&gt;f : completeTask(courseId, planId, taskId)
f-&gt;g : markTaskDone(courseId, planId, taskId)
g-&gt;r : loadPlan(planId)
r.&gt;g : course-scoped plan
combinedFragment=opt~complete g r; t:[Only if task is not already done]
g-&gt;t : markDone()
t:completedAt is set once to the actual completion time
g-&gt;r : savePlan(plan including completedAt)
r.&gt;g : saved or strict primary error
--
g:On primary error do not publish progress
g-&gt;p : recordTaskDone(courseId, task)
p:Count stable task ID once, use the saved completion time
p.&gt;g : progress update complete
g.&gt;f : completion recorded
f.&gt;u : completion or primary error
g:Legacy completed tasks without a timestamp keep it unknown</panel_attributes>
